We have quite a few documents where it is desirable for them actually to be
separate documents, but in which there are frequent cross-references between
those documents. My point is that it is not a solution to combine all of them
into one document using \include.

Will a user mechanism be provided for xxx.tex to read yyy.aux, or whatever
the equivalent might be in LaTeX2e/3?

Sorry if this has already been discussed.

Mike Piff
